EITHER VIA SBN OR WAN TO ALL AWIPS SITES. THIS PRODUCT IS USED

FOR PERFORMANCE MEASUREMENTS AND WILL BE RECEIVED

OVER THE WAN (NCFHPTNCF) OR SBN (NCFWTSNCF and NCFTSTNCF) BY ALL SITES.



