ADMN75 PAAQ 021420



OBSERVATORY MESSAGE

QUAKE OF AUG 2



PRELIMINARY EARTHQUAKE PARAMETERS

---------------------------------



 * The following parameters are based on a rapid preliminary

   assessment of the earthquake and changes may occur.



 * Magnitude      Mwp 6.0 - 8 station average

 * Origin Time    0614 AKDT Aug 02 2025

                  0714  PDT Aug 02 2025

                  1414  UTC Aug 02 2025

 * Coordinates    51.6 North 159.4 East

 * Depth          21 miles

 * Location       365 miles SW of Bering I., Komandorski

                  105 miles SE of Petropavlovsk, Kamchatka





ADDITIONAL INFORMATION

----------------------

 * The location and magnitude may change as more data becomes 

   available.

 * The location and magnitude are based on preliminary information. 

 * Further information will be issued by the United States 

   Geological Survey (earthquake.usgs.gov) or the appropriate 

   regional seismic network.



$$



